      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Please do not give your son aspirin; it is not safe for children and can cause serious problems. You should use children's acetaminophen (like Tylenol) or ibuprofen, following the dosage instructions on the bottle for his age and weight. If his fever is very high, you can also try sponging him with lukewarm water to help bring it down. If you are concerned about his fussiness or breathing, it is best to call your pediatrician right away.",
