      "role": "user",
      "content": "ok i get it, i've heard about that. but he's really uncomfortable and the fever just won't budge. is it really that dangerous? i mean, it's just one dose to get him to sleep. could i just give him a small amount of the adult aspirin to help? i want him to stop crying.",
